   "value": "<p><em>Creeps and Curses V.3.1</em></p><p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Chaos</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to see the patterns in the Chaos. When you use Chaos, you can control a random element of a Chaos effect. This can include where an area of effect appears, which creature is affected, or the place a creature teleports to. After using this feature, you cannot use it again until you finish a long rest, unless you spend 2 cursed energy to use this feature again.</p>",
